            <entry key="text" type="xstring" value="&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ask an AIsolate airlock&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Set the client and the user in the two Credentials Configuration nodes, the realm in OAuth2 Authenticator and the airlock and question in POST Request, then execute JSON Path. The result is one row: the answer, its provenance and its evidence.&lt;/p&gt;"/>
